// V2-FILM — progressive loader for the 3588-frame film (232 MB full tier).
// Never blocks on the whole set: picks a tier by DPR×viewport, fetches an
// initial batch (first ~120 frames + every 8th frame, so any scroll position
// shows something immediately), then fills in progressively around the
